# Copy to .env and fill in from your Supabase project:
#   Dashboard → Project Settings → API
#
# Both of these are public values. The anon key is meant to be sent to browsers
# — row level security is what protects the data, not the secrecy of this key.
#
# The service_role key is NOT public and must never appear here. Anything named
# VITE_* is compiled into the JavaScript that ships to every visitor, and the
# service_role key bypasses row level security entirely.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
